# Local Hot Reload proof harness artifacts (see src/test-proof/README.md). These hold full copies of
# real VS Code extensions and user-data dirs and run to well over a gigabyte, which otherwise lands
# in the packaged VSIX and makes `vsce package` time out.
.proof-extensions*/**
.proof-user-data*/**
.vscode-test-*.mjs
